    "updated_at": "2021-01-23T16:03:08Z",
    "body": "In regards to the [Introduction to Flatpak](https://docs.flatpak.org/en/latest/introduction.html#target-audience) documentation, the target audience are _desktop application_ and _Starship_ is console/terminal/CLI tool. \r\n\r\nI also searched for other CLI tools (like _bat_, _ripgrep_, _htop_, etc.) on [Flathub](https://flathub.org/home), but couldn't find any of those. I also checked the categories to find any other CLI tools and didn't found any.\r\n\r\nIMHO, at the current date Flatpak is meant for GUI applications and therefore I would suggest to close this issue.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
